"  1. controllers: only validate request, identify device, return protocol response.\n"
"  2. services/zkteco_protocol.py: parse ZKTeco payloads and build command payloads.\n"
"  3. services/zkteco_sync.py: idempotent business logic for users, events, attendance punches.\n"
